  [Fintype.{u_2} m] [Fintype.{u_3} n] [Fintype.{u_4} p] [NonUnitalCommSemiring.{u_6} R]
  (A : Matrix.{u_2, u_3, u_6} m n R) (B : Matrix.{u_3, u_4, u_6} n p R) (C : Matrix.{u_4, u_2, u_6} p m R) :
